    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Brain and neurological conditions are becoming more common across Africa, yet research in this area is still limited. To help address this gap, the Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) at Aga Khan University held a practical training workshop on July 2 and 3, 2025, in Nairobi. The focus was on strengthening research skills in neuroimaging, wearable technology, and artificial intelligence.",
